---
title: Завдання 2. Стан замовлення (State) — кінотеатр «Кадр»
---
classDiagram
    direction LR

    class Order {
        <<Context>>
        -int id
        -List~String~ seats
        -OrderState state
        +Order(id int, seats List~String~)
        +changeSeats(newSeats List~String~) void
        +reserve() void
        +pay() void
        +refund() void
        +enterHall() void
        +cancel() void
        +waitMinutes(minutes int) void
        ~setState(newState OrderState) void
        ~setSeats(seats List~String~) void
    }

    class OrderState {
        <<interface>>
        <<State>>
        +getName() String
        +changeSeats(order Order, newSeats List~String~) void
        +reserve(order Order) void
        +pay(order Order) void
        +refund(order Order) void
        +enterHall(order Order) void
        +cancel(order Order) void
        +waitMinutes(order Order, minutes int) void
    }

    class BaseOrderState {
        <<abstract>>
        +changeSeats(order Order, newSeats List~String~) void
        +reserve(order Order) void
        +pay(order Order) void
        +refund(order Order) void
        +enterHall(order Order) void
        +cancel(order Order) void
        +waitMinutes(order Order, minutes int) void
        -deny(operation String, reason String) void
    }

    class CartState {
        <<ConcreteState>>
        +changeSeats(...) void
        +reserve(...) void
        +cancel(...) void
    }
    class ReservedState {
        <<ConcreteState>>
        +RESERVATION_MINUTES int$
        -int waited
        +pay(...) void
        +cancel(...) void
        +waitMinutes(...) void
    }
    class PaidState {
        <<ConcreteState>>
        +refund(...) void
        +enterHall(...) void
    }
    class UsedState {
        <<ConcreteState>>
    }
    class CancelledState {
        <<ConcreteState>>
    }

Order o--> "1" OrderState : state
OrderState <|.. BaseOrderState
BaseOrderState <|-- CartState
BaseOrderState <|-- ReservedState
BaseOrderState <|-- PaidState
BaseOrderState <|-- UsedState
BaseOrderState <|-- CancelledState

CartState ..> ReservedState : reserve
CartState ..> CancelledState : cancel
ReservedState ..> PaidState : pay
ReservedState ..> CancelledState : cancel / 15 хв
PaidState ..> UsedState : enterHall
PaidState ..> CancelledState : refund